Description: Proton VPN Core with a verified Plasma interoperability overlay
 Proton's exact Ubuntu 5.6.10 API-Core payload with narrowly verified memory,
 diagnostic-hygiene, and Plasma interoperability patches. The Protun private
 key remains an unsaved per-connection secret held by NetworkManager for the
 lifetime of the connection. Proton's compiled networking components and
 privileged service boundary are preserved without modification.
 .
 This is an unofficial downstream rebuild maintained by Plasma VPN.
